{"articleNo":"504106","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=504106&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[대학본부] 도서관 광장 및 문화복합시설 구축 제안설계 공모 결과 안내","writer":"시설안전과","writeDate":"2024.12.30","hit":"19111","attachments":[{"name":"심사결과.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=504106&attachNo=139787"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">「도서관 광장 및 문화복합시설 구축</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">」&nbsp;제안&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">설계공모 심사결과 공고</span></p><div class=\"hwp_editor_board_content\" id=\"hwpEditorBoardContent\" data-jsonlen=\"5510\" data-hjsonver=\"1.0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></div><p class=\"0\" style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-align: center;\"><br></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">1.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우리대학교 시설사업에 관심과 참여를 표하여 주신 것에 깊은 감사를 드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">2.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우리대학교 수요사업으로써 공고된&nbsp;</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">′도서관 광장 및 문화복합시설 구축 제안&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">설계공모</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">′</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">에 대한 공모안 심사결과를 아래와 같이 공고합니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>- 1</strong></span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\"><strong>위&nbsp;</strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><strong>: (주)담엔지니어링 종합건축사사무소</strong>&nbsp;<strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&lt;</span>당선작<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&gt;</span></strong></strong></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">- 2</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">위&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">: 시소건축사사무소&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">우수작</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt;\">&gt;</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-seri